============================================================
PHASE 13 — RELEASE APPROVAL
============================================================

Use:

07_RELEASE/RELEASE_CHECKLIST.md

Release status:

[ ] READY
[ ] BLOCKED
[ ] CONDITIONAL

READY only if all mandatory checks pass.

BLOCKED if any mandatory check fails.

CONDITIONAL only if an explicitly accepted non-critical issue exists.

Do NOT mark READY because:

[ ] Compilation succeeded
[ ] Development server worked
[ ] UI preview worked
[ ] AI produced one response

Require actual evidence.

